# The repository ignores *.pdf, because the six official BIR source forms must
# never be committed: they are official documents, and extract.py pins them by
# sha256 precisely so a substituted file fails loudly rather than silently.
#
# These six are the opposite case. They are synthetic, built by make_fixtures.py
# in this directory, and they exist so extract.py --self-test can run in CI at
# all. Tracking them is the whole point, so the ignore is undone here and only
# here, by name -- an unqualified `!*.pdf` would re-admit any official PDF a
# future hand happened to drop in this directory.
!rules.pdf
!paths.pdf
!masks.pdf
!flip.pdf
!glyphs.pdf
!lean.pdf
